{"id":"n38311-2-9","stage":5,"title":"기색 · 迹象","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n38311-2-9-1","ko":"병원 치료를 받아 보니 어때? 좀 나아지는 기색이 있어?","zh":"去医院接受治疗怎么样？有没有稍微好转的迹象？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"병원","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}},{"text":"치료를","meaning":"治疗","explanation":"치료：治疗；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"치료","audio":"/audio/6f44a9c1f36d86e996c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83170","senseId":"1","lemma":"치료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치료를","audio":"/audio/8d768130adca62c12574.mp3"}},{"text":"받아","meaning":"接受，遭受，经受，承蒙","explanation":"받다：接受，遭受，经受，承蒙；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"3","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받아","audio":"/audio/0a0a7a563f5137f6e18d.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}},{"text":"어때?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어때","audio":"/audio/b8638c1eedbc8ab7e09d.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entr